{"4449100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lightscape", "steam_appid": 4449100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449100/extras/49813c804ba3baa3000598b0ad50e0ba.avif?t=1786414178\" width=1280 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, platform and blast your thrusters full-speed through futuristic virtual worlds to network your way home through the stars. Steer your ship while navigating and overcoming Lightscape's many defenses while upgrading your ship to battle against ever increasing challenges and enemies in each level. A retro third-person shooter platformer that's easy to learn, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449100/extras/cfbd6c14123119069f93a04e49b35dce.avif?t=1786414178\" width=786 height=318 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful futuristic retro virtual worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls: Steer, shoot, boost, and swap weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and furious player movement and enemy combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to purchase power ups and upgrades!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Additional challenge levels, in addition to the main game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mode: Standalone mode that has you face against ever-increasing enemies in an arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449100/extras/49813c804ba3baa3000598b0ad50e0ba.avif?t=1786414178\" width=1280 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, platform and blast your thrusters full-speed through futuristic virtual worlds to network your way home through the stars. Steer your ship while navigating and overcoming Lightscape's many defenses while upgrading your ship to battle against ever increasing challenges and enemies in each level. A retro third-person shooter platformer that's easy to learn, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449100/extras/cfbd6c14123119069f93a04e49b35dce.avif?t=1786414178\" width=786 height=318 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful futuristic retro virtual worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls: Steer, shoot, boost, and swap weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and furious player movement and enemy combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to purchase power ups and upgrades!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Additional challenge levels, in addition to the main game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mode: Standalone mode that has you face against ever-increasing enemies in an arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Shoot, platform and blast your thrusters full-speed through futuristic virtual worlds to network your way home through the stars. Steer your ship while collecting upgrades to overcome increasingly challenging levels. A retro third-person shooter platformer that's easy to learn, hard to master!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<st